Running the test again will make Pharo suggest to create the missing ''fromFile:withApp:'' method for you.

% ${changes:path=code/032-EDASStompTopicListenerSettingsJsonAdapter_class_fromFile_withApp_.ombu}
[[[methodDefinition=true
EDASStompTopicListenerSettingsJsonAdapter class >> fromFile: aFileReference withApp: anEDAApplication

	| result json commandListener |
	result := self withApp: anEDAApplication.
	result host: 'localhost'.
	^ result
]]]

Now that the test passes with the naive implementation, it's time to define a new test.

% ${changes:path=code/033-EDASStompTopicListenerSettingsJsonAdapterTest_testHost_127_0_0_1_.ombu}
[[[methodDefinition=true
EDASStompTopicListenerSettingsJsonAdapterTest >> testHost_127_0_0_1

	| json dict tempFile commandListener |
	tempFile := FileReference
		            newTempFilePrefix:
		            'EDASStompTopicListenerSettingsJsonAdapterTest'
		            suffix: '.json'.
	commandListener := Dictionary new.
	commandListener at: 'host' put: '127.0.0.1'.
	dict := Dictionary new.
	dict at: 'commandListener' put: commandListener.
	json := String streamContents: [ :stream |
		        (NeoJSONWriter on: stream)
			        asciiOnly: true;
			        nextPut: dict ].
	tempFile writeStreamDo: [ :s | s nextPutAll: json ].
	self
		assert:
			(EDASStompTopicListenerSettingsJsonAdapter fromFile: tempFile withApp: nil) host
			= '127.0.0.1'
		description: 'Host parsing failed'
		resumable: true.
	tempFile delete
]]]

The new test will fail, forcing us to actually read the JSON file.

% ${changes:path=code/034-EDASStompTopicListenerSettingsJsonAdapter_class_fromFile_withApp_.ombu}
[[[methodDefinition=true
EDASStompTopicListenerSettingsJsonAdapter class >> fromFile: aFileReference withApp: anEDAApplication

	| result json commandListener |
	result := self withApp: anEDAApplication.
	json := (NeoJSONReader on: aFileReference readStream) next.
	commandListener := json at: 'commandListener'.
	result host: (commandListener at: 'host').
	^ result
]]]

Let's do the same for the other fields, skipping the naive implementations altogether.

% ${changes:path=code/035-EDASStompTopicListenerSettingsJsonAdapterTest_testPort.ombu}
[[[methodDefinition=true
EDASStompTopicListenerSettingsJsonAdapterTest >> testPort

	| json dict tempFile commandListener |
